#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:143
#: b14d3a6a6d9641e597db735f545ad183
msgid ""
"Position controller diagram showing the chirp being input at the desired "
"velocity.  Both the velocity and position feedback loops are being used.  "
"This input would be used to analyze data to determine position or tracking "
"bandwidth."
msgstr "位置控制器框图，显示 chirp 在期望速度处注入。速度和位置反馈环路均被使用。此输入用于分析数据以确定位置或跟踪带宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:147
#: 2d4d7032c7664e6b87b10b5eac8fee1e
msgid ""
"Position controller diagram showing the chirp being input at the desired "
"velocity.  Only the velocity feedback loop is being used.  This input would "
"be used to analyze data to determine the velocity bandwidth."
msgstr "位置控制器框图，显示 chirp 在期望速度处注入。仅使用速度反馈环路。此输入用于分析数据以确定速度带宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:151
#: c90ef51a2f754c488ceedec34867e741
msgid ""
"Position controller diagram showing the chirp being input at the measured "
"position.  Both the velocity and position feedback loops are being used.  "
"This input would be used to analyze data to determine the position "
"disturbance rejection bandwidth."
msgstr "位置控制器框图，显示 chirp 在测量位置处注入。速度和位置反馈环路均被使用。此输入用于分析数据以确定位置扰动抑制带宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:155
#: 1e48a12329584a359ff64cc014f7411a
msgid ""
"Position controller diagram showing the chirp being input at the measured "
"velocity.  Only the velocity feedback loop is being used.  This input would "
"be used to analyze data to determine the velocity disturbance rejection "
"bandwidth."
msgstr "位置控制器框图，显示 chirp 在测量速度处注入。仅使用速度反馈环路。此输入用于分析数据以确定速度扰动抑制带宽。"
